{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-09T12:57:56.384Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"8bca0b4be72a52f0b6f99b13","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-09T12:57:56.384Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-09T12:57:56.384Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Revert proof: the new test 'guardSubmitted refuses sparse arrays whose length exceeds the traversal budget' fails without the bound and passes with it; test/edge.test.ts passes in full."}]}],"before_hash":"52e12cfe44215e73e458193ade018346278e50c38411040b0cde576f9c5cb32a","after_hash":"087d51ee660f4bd5edb9ee2db6b6d3d436073a593c63ef6bc9549c92304d7faf","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"026a241f8c4acb8d856a38135ca0150452fe9a9cfef801be43ff39b998078bec"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-09T15:05:09.655Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"8bca0b4be72a52f0b6f99b13","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-09T15:05:09.653Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Correction after CodeRabbit PRRT_kwDOVll0Ws61TTim and a full-suite run: the per-array cap of 32768 from e345c7a broke the existing contract test 'aggregate node scanning bounds shared graphs and primitive arrays', which allows a dense array of 262143 entries (only the edge file had been run). Many sparse arrays below that cap (127 x 32768 holes) also still passed. The guard now charges each array's holes (length minus present entries; present entries are charged when visited) to the existing 262144 aggregate node budget, with no per-array cap. Full suite 82/82; the holes regression fails against main's guard and passes restored."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-09T15:05:09.655Z"}],"before_hash":"087d51ee660f4bd5edb9ee2db6b6d3d436073a593c63ef6bc9549c92304d7faf","after_hash":"a8dcd98290913bbad65054aa8346c80c2ea58c6fba3fb1d9c553006064c110bf","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"cdd6b3544ecb3ad413ebac62508bf34c386b3d18051e836abdf11edee0e4c337"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-09T17:25:51.018Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"8bca0b4be72a52f0b6f99b13","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-09T17:25:51.018Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"CodeRabbit PRRT_kwDOVll0Ws61W80k (IMPORTANT): the holes charge counted Object.keys, which named properties inflate. The class is now closed by accepting only arrays whose keys are exactly 0..length-1 (JSON arrays never have holes); the length is checked against the 262144 aggregate node budget before the keys are listed. This also closes values inherited from Array.prototype through a hole (the sibling finding on pm-unit). The documented dense 262143 boundary is unchanged. 'guardSubmitted accepts only dense JSON arrays within the aggregate node budget' fails against the holes-charge version; full suite 82/82."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-09T17:25:51.018Z"}],"before_hash":"a8dcd98290913bbad65054aa8346c80c2ea58c6fba3fb1d9c553006064c110bf","after_hash":"03c53cf49e30ddb9b2f6c8e83b1963a34008ca2715d48e84c00a7c4738ac60dd","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"c7d06bd72649fa54ba566b7d3787e48a6c1eb311967e04be23c1ef50d6465df5"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-10T13:40:47.833Z","author":"claude-orchestrator","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"34569ddecaea7f35ebc61713","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-10T13:40:47.833Z","author":"claude-orchestrator","text":"Orchestrator fix febb17a: CI's review-revert gate failed ('Expected test assertion failure in src/privacy.ts'). The node-budget mutation (++nodes <= 262144 -> ++nodes >= 0) was no longer caught, because the up-front array-length charge added in f9208eb also refuses the all-array DAG. Objects never take that charge, so test/round2.test.ts now also submits a 24^4 shared object graph. Mutation: 0 pass / 1 fail with 'Every graph visit must consume a finite budget'. Code: 1/0. Full npm test 82/0; revert-gate 10/10 reverts detected; review-revert-gate 32 defects detected, all restored tests pass."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-10T13:40:47.833Z"}],"before_hash":"03c53cf49e30ddb9b2f6c8e83b1963a34008ca2715d48e84c00a7c4738ac60dd","after_hash":"993ff0b024bc77367ca9bf7ea18d0e9be48ae9374bbee1200d767dea94ee63af","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"53997c81b64a42566bd1038d65d6d491939bb4411e328472e3e815a94f28a11e"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-10T13:42:03.746Z","author":"claude-orchestrator","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"34569ddecaea7f35ebc61713","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Sparse arrays (keys not exactly 0..length-1, including new Array(2**31)) are refused with invalid_input before schema validation; Dense arrays are accepted within the aggregate node budget: a 262143-entry array passes and 262144 refuses; Every graph visit consumes the aggregate budget: shared array and shared object graphs past 262144 visits refuse, and each regression fails on revert"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-10T13:42:03.746Z"}],"before_hash":"993ff0b024bc77367ca9bf7ea18d0e9be48ae9374bbee1200d767dea94ee63af","after_hash":"9d465e49f4ceab0ae698bffd19e0ed838de6efac43c33a00aaf0418fecc1abc0","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"ef4cd3652575cb14e2fa60fccc2c922b2689e2402fa14da9050abf40626d86fb"}
